 # 8\. AI Requirements

 The AI component is responsible for understanding and generating educational responses.

 The system should support:

 - Natural-language questions
- Contextual explanations
- Summarization
- Question generation
- Answer feedback
- Follow-up interactions

 The application should also handle AI-service errors and avoid presenting generated content as guaranteed factual information when verification is necessary.

