 # 13\. Constraints

 The project may have the following constraints:

 - Internet connectivity is required for cloud-based AI services.
- Gemini API availability and applicable usage limits can affect AI functionality.
- AI-generated responses may occasionally require verification.
- Application performance depends partly on network and external API response times.
- Database and authentication services require proper configuration.

